[17592186493359 1071 "Consider the following initial value problem\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{-y},\\,y(1)=-1.\n$$\n\nYou're given that $y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(A+x)$ is the solution to this initial value problem. What is the value of the constant $A?$\n\n$A=${{field-1}}" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493359 1072 #uuid "b21bbef4-9add-53b4-bc34-6d945d14d134" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493359 1074 "We're given that $y=\\ln(A+x)$ is the solution to the initial value problem. Therefore, it must satisfy the differential equation *and* the initial condition $y(1)=-1.$\n\nSubstituting the initial condition $y(1)=-1$ into our solution and solving for $A,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\ln(A+x) \\\\ -1 & =\\ln(A+1) \\\\ {e}^{-1} & ={e}^{\\ln(A+1)} \\\\ e^{-1} & =A+1 \\\\ A & ={e}^{-1}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186493351 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493360 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493360 1077 "field-1" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493360 1078 #edb/ref 17592186493351 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493360 1079 #uuid "b772fdc6-384f-5b49-a09f-cd4b45cbd1a1" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493361 1080 "e^{- \\frac{9}{2}}" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493361 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493361 1083 #uuid "bbf7abd5-bfb9-5aba-b550-2a9cc3191d8e" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493362 1075 #edb/ref 17592186493347 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493362 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493362 1077 "field-1" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493362 1078 #edb/ref 17592186493347 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493362 1079 #uuid "bfb8d739-6087-5cb0-989a-1441bdf28bf6" 13194139535313 17592186045443 true] [17592186493363 10